DESCRIPTION:Let's Walk!!\nJoin me for a loop or two around the reservoir. 
 Each loop is 1.75 miles. We will Meet at the Pavilion.\n\nThere is a parki
 ng lot across the street from the Pavilion\n\nHeavy Rain or extreme weathe
