BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Meetup: Let's Walk!!
UID:event_316702834@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260926T045342Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261009T093000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261009T113000
SUMMARY:🥾 Let's Hike!! the Turtle Back Trail loop
DESCRIPTION:Let's Walk!!\n**Lets celebrate National Hiking Day!!**\n\nCome
  walk 2 or 4 miles along woods trails in South Mountain Reservation near t
 he Turtle Back Rock. We'll take parts of the Hillspur and Turtle Back trai
 ls to make 2 custom loops. Stay for one or both 😁.\n\nThese trails are 
 gentle\, **but are not for beginners**. If you've walked with us at Eagle 
 Rock\, this is similar in difficulty. There may be wet or muddy sections a
 nd lots of rocks and tree roots. Please wear hiking boots/shoes and bring 
 trekking poles or a walking stick.\n\nDon't forget your water!\n\nInclemen
 t weather may cancel this event. Please check the event page for comments 
 prior to leaving for the meetup.\n\n**Please arrive 5 minutes early so we 
 can start on time.**\n\n**Disclaimer:** If you join this event\, please un
 derstand that you are responsible for your own preparedness and well-being
  and will hold no one else liable in case of injury or mishap.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/lets-walkprogram/events/316702834/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260925T010320Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260925T010320Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
